  "note": "Pinned AIOStreams release tag used to regenerate src/data/generated/* and src/config/generated/*. `ref` MUST be a release tag and `sha` MUST be the commit that tag resolves to \u2014 scripts/sync-upstream.mjs verifies this against the remote and refuses to run otherwise, so the drift report always diffs release-to-release. Bump ref+sha+version together, run `npm run sync:upstream`, review the drift report, then commit the regenerated files with this pin.",
  "sameContractSince": "2.35.4",
  "sameContractNote": "Oldest release whose extracted contract is identical to this pin (v2.35.4 0eccbc7 vs v2.35.7: only upstream.sha/version differ, checked 2026-10-03). Output for the pin is safe on any host at or above it; tests/host-routing.test.mjs holds every registry host to it. Re-check when bumping the pin."
